<!--
  Location pin, for the prayer widget's title bar beside the place name.

  MingCute "location-fill" (Apache-2.0, github.com/Richard9394/MingCute) — the same
  licence as the Material Symbols already in this project, so it carries no attribution
  obligation of its own.

  Filled and single-path, because Glance tints a title bar icon with a ColorFilter over
  the whole image: only a shape that reads by its silhouette survives that at 24dp. The
  earlier ic_go_to_mosque_pin draws hairline 0.8-1.5dp strokes that disappear at this
  size, and Material's own location_on is drawn noticeably more slender, so it read as
  thin next to the bolder type this title bar sits above.

  The trailing subpath is the inner circle. It is wound opposite to the body, so the
  default nonZero fill rule punches it out as a hole rather than filling it — do not
  "tidy" its sweep flags.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
